WEBVTT

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:15.840
On that cold night, I came to realize

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:20.820
that there's a place deeper down
that hurts even more than injuries

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:26.050
In this world painted with lies

00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:30.660
where it's not clear what's true anymore

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:33.560
I wanted to keep you safe

00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:40.700
The moment that
distortion and love overlapped,

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:48.780
the wind embraced the
sadness that had closed in

00:00:48.780 --> 00:01:00.090
I'll never forget your sole voice
that continues to echo through the sky

00:01:00.090 --> 00:01:08.930
The prayer is going to melt
away and disappear, just like snow

00:01:08.930 --> 00:01:13.570
Today, I'll increase my speed again

00:01:13.570 --> 00:01:17.670
as I search for the reason for living

00:01:17.670 --> 00:01:29.070
even if I can't be a hero just yet

00:01:31.520 --> 00:01:35.660
I'm a member of XAT to the
very end, no matter what happens.

00:01:35.660 --> 00:01:40.360
I don't know how long
this body will stay together,

00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:43.570
but even so, there's something
I have to do before I kick the bucket.

00:01:43.570 --> 00:01:44.930
I'm coming with you.

00:01:44.930 --> 00:01:48.770
It'll be XAT that brings him down for good!

00:01:48.770 --> 00:01:53.810
Thanks. With us teamed up,
there's nothing to fear!

00:01:53.810 --> 00:01:57.080
The Blassreiter enhancement
system just achieved completion.

00:01:57.080 --> 00:02:01.080
This is the perfect opportunity.
I'm sending your brother in.

00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:05.220
Hold on! There's still too much
we don't know about that system!

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:08.820
If it looks like our three
units really isn't enough,

00:02:08.820 --> 00:02:12.280
then you can do whatever you deem is best.

00:02:49.030 --> 00:02:51.370
Send Joseph into the battle.

00:02:51.370 --> 00:02:56.040
B-But, sir! The enhancement
measures finished only moments ago!

00:02:56.040 --> 00:02:57.500
That's an order!

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:46.620
It's been a while, XAT Attack Squad #2.

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:48.820
Wolf...

00:03:48.820 --> 00:03:54.760
It's nice to see my crew again.
Hermann Saltza and Amanda Werner...

00:04:02.640 --> 00:04:06.270
Damn! They just keep coming!
How many are there?!

00:04:06.270 --> 00:04:07.510
Hermann! Behind you!

00:04:07.510 --> 00:04:09.410
No, you don't!

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:15.750
I see you're still a great two-man team.

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:18.910
But how long can you last?

00:04:27.460 --> 00:04:29.120
What?!

00:04:33.970 --> 00:04:37.800
Not bad! But that's enough of that!

00:04:39.510 --> 00:04:42.140
Damn! She's not letting us back down!

00:04:55.690 --> 00:04:58.220
So you've finally joined the party, Blue...

00:04:59.530 --> 00:05:02.050
Alright! Take care of him!

00:05:15.740 --> 00:05:18.370
What are you doing?! Get him!

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:25.150
Wh-What's going on?!

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:29.390
The Demoniacs have left Wolf's control?!

00:05:32.960 --> 00:05:35.520
- What's going on?!
- What happened?!

00:05:39.630 --> 00:05:42.360
Someone of even higher rank than Wolf...

00:06:04.690 --> 00:06:06.350
Is this?!

00:06:12.200 --> 00:06:16.140
The enhancement unit is
more effective than I imagined...

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:39.490
Joseph...

00:06:44.030 --> 00:06:45.690
Go!

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:00.140
If this keeps up!

00:07:47.130 --> 00:07:49.330
That's right! Come after me!

00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:51.560
What is he planning to do?

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:55.640
Come on, you bastard!

00:07:55.640 --> 00:07:57.010
Oh no!

00:07:57.010 --> 00:07:59.370
He's all yours, Hermann!

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:05.210
You...

00:08:08.320 --> 00:08:10.380
It's time for you...

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:20.950
It's time for you to pay!

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:26.770
Hermann!

00:08:26.770 --> 00:08:30.700
Stay back! He has to pay for Gerd and Malek!

00:08:32.570 --> 00:08:34.730
Damn you, Wolf...

00:08:38.680 --> 00:08:40.340
Guess it's time to go...

00:08:42.280 --> 00:08:43.940
Stop!

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:46.280
Sasha.

00:09:00.670 --> 00:09:02.400
Stop, Joseph!

00:09:08.580 --> 00:09:10.940
The enhancement unit is making him...

00:09:14.180 --> 00:09:17.550
You turned my brother into a cripple!

00:09:25.590 --> 00:09:27.250
Joseph!

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:36.660
Joseph!

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:43.640
You okay, Amanda?!
Bastard tried to kill you, too!

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:48.780
No, Hermann... It's because of
his enhancement unit that he's!

00:10:01.560 --> 00:10:03.220
Amanda!

00:10:04.900 --> 00:10:08.770
Move aside, Amanda! This
constitutes a breach of Zwolf's trust!

00:10:08.770 --> 00:10:11.710
I'm a member of XAT!

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:15.340
As long as I'm here, Amanda is in danger!

00:10:27.050 --> 00:10:28.720
Joseph...

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:37.520
Joseph!

00:10:49.440 --> 00:10:51.880
He's on a senseless rampage!

00:10:51.880 --> 00:10:54.120
Go! I don't have time to look after you!

00:10:54.120 --> 00:10:55.780
Shido!

00:10:55.780 --> 00:10:58.450
You probably know this, but
you have no place to return to now

00:10:58.450 --> 00:11:00.980
unless you defeat Wolf!

00:11:06.990 --> 00:11:08.660
I understand...

00:11:20.440 --> 00:11:22.470
Stop, Joseph!

00:11:36.860 --> 00:11:38.350
Joseph...

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:46.460
Retreat.

00:11:50.470 --> 00:11:54.940
Are you deaf?! Have the
Apocalypse Knights retreat!

00:11:54.940 --> 00:11:57.110
Y-Yes, sir!

00:11:57.110 --> 00:11:59.610
Apocalypse Knights! Retreat at once!

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:02.520
Sasha! We have orders to retreat!

00:12:02.520 --> 00:12:04.690
But I have to stop him!

00:12:04.690 --> 00:12:07.180
That isn't your brother anymore!

00:12:08.060 --> 00:12:11.390
Not even your death could stop him now!

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:18.030
Even so, he's still my brother!

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:20.860
Damn!

00:12:25.240 --> 00:12:26.900
Mei-Fong!

00:12:35.920 --> 00:12:39.750
Joseph! Joseph!

00:12:52.470 --> 00:12:56.900
As you can see, the
Amalgam infection in Germany

00:12:56.900 --> 00:13:00.210
is spreading at an alarming speed.

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:02.210
At this rate, it is only a matter of time

00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:06.680
until the damage spills
into neighboring countries.

00:13:06.680 --> 00:13:10.420
We believe that the best way to
handle this unprecedented disaster

00:13:10.420 --> 00:13:13.650
is for the international
community to come together

00:13:13.650 --> 00:13:20.220
and deploy a multinational force
into Germany as quickly as possible.

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:26.520
What is your opinion, Ambassador Schwarz?

00:13:28.470 --> 00:13:29.840
Secretary General.

00:13:29.840 --> 00:13:33.040
My country is currently
taking heavy-handed measures

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:35.610
to bring the situation under control.

00:13:35.610 --> 00:13:38.210
Then how do you explain the fact

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:42.680
that you've yet to determine
the source of the infection?

00:13:42.680 --> 00:13:44.090
Well, uhh...

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:47.490
Even more concerning are the
reports that your public safety

00:13:47.490 --> 00:13:52.060
is currently in the hands
of a private organization...

00:13:52.060 --> 00:13:57.800
Your country has a leading
role in the international community.

00:13:57.800 --> 00:14:05.340
Do you fully understand how much
of a threat to world peace there is

00:14:05.340 --> 00:14:09.340
when political unrest
takes hold in such a nation?

00:14:09.340 --> 00:14:13.410
My country is determined to
contain this situation on its own!

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:18.080
This problem now threatens
more than your country alone.

00:14:24.730 --> 00:14:26.630
Ambassador Schwarz.

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:31.400
I'm told that XAT, your special
anti-Amalgam unit, has been destroyed,

00:14:31.400 --> 00:14:36.700
and that Amalgams have
even taken over an air force base.

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:46.480
Your government has already lost
its capability to control the situation.

00:14:46.480 --> 00:14:50.690
Our only choice now is to deploy
a multinational coalition immediately.

00:14:50.690 --> 00:14:52.920
During which time, of course,

00:14:52.920 --> 00:15:00.390
your nation's sovereignty will be
temporarily handed over to the coalition.

00:15:00.390 --> 00:15:03.660
Our sovereignty, handed over?

00:15:13.570 --> 00:15:20.880
They're trying to use a coalition
occupation to seize control of our country.

00:15:20.880 --> 00:15:22.820
I suppose it's only natural.

00:15:22.820 --> 00:15:24.690
What do you mean, it's only natural?!

00:15:24.690 --> 00:15:29.820
Your inability to recapture the
air base is what brought this upon us!

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:33.290
Don't you feel any sense of responsibility?!

00:15:33.290 --> 00:15:37.930
Your credibility in the
international community plummeted

00:15:37.930 --> 00:15:40.570
the moment the air base was taken over.

00:15:40.570 --> 00:15:44.070
Just so you know, if a
coalition is stationed here,

00:15:44.070 --> 00:15:47.010
you'll be under their command as well!

00:15:47.010 --> 00:15:52.180
Sorry, but Zwolf's history far
predates any of your governments.

00:15:52.180 --> 00:15:54.120
No matter what the situation,

00:15:54.120 --> 00:15:58.480
Zwolf will continue to deal
with the Amalgams on its own.

00:16:00.620 --> 00:16:06.190
Indeed, government is powerless
before the Amalgam infection.

00:16:06.190 --> 00:16:08.060
Chancellor...

00:16:08.060 --> 00:16:13.930
The world's superpowers have
yet to realize the infection's terror.

00:16:16.740 --> 00:16:25.880
Victor. Can Zwolf save humankind
from this horrifying calamity?

00:16:25.880 --> 00:16:31.940
Chancellor. Salvation of
mankind is the reason Zwolf exists.

00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:19.460
Shido!

00:17:22.000 --> 00:17:24.200
Sorry about earlier...

00:17:25.210 --> 00:17:28.440
I hope to never hear you say that again.

00:18:11.750 --> 00:18:15.090
So we're really using the anti-nanomachines?

00:18:15.090 --> 00:18:19.960
B-But development on the
anti-nanomachines was frozen!

00:18:19.960 --> 00:18:23.960
As our weapons have the
possibility of running berserk,

00:18:23.960 --> 00:18:29.140
it is ultimately necessary to have
measures in place to destroy them.

00:18:29.140 --> 00:18:33.540
We will now recommence
development of anti-nanomachines

00:18:33.540 --> 00:18:37.310
capable of destroying
nanomachines inside Blassreiters!

00:18:40.880 --> 00:18:45.750
Sorry, but it looks like
I really overrated you, Wolf.

00:18:45.750 --> 00:18:47.290
Beatrice...

00:18:47.290 --> 00:18:49.650
You're on your own now.

00:18:56.230 --> 00:18:59.770
That's fine. I'll do things my own way!

00:18:59.770 --> 00:19:01.570
I'll take down Hermann,

00:19:01.570 --> 00:19:04.670
and then I'll rid Blue from
this world once and for all,

00:19:04.670 --> 00:19:07.440
since you couldn't defeat him!

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:17.540
You've done very well for me, Al.

00:19:18.890 --> 00:19:21.290
Yes, Boss...

00:19:26.160 --> 00:19:29.360
I'm certain Hermann is chasing Wolf.

00:19:41.880 --> 00:19:43.540
Hermann!

00:20:14.710 --> 00:20:16.230
What a rare sight.

00:20:18.050 --> 00:20:21.280
To think that you'd be injured...

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:23.680
Xargin-sama...

00:20:23.680 --> 00:20:26.780
I wouldn't consider this an injury...

00:20:48.840 --> 00:20:50.710
Does it hurt?

00:21:01.790 --> 00:21:04.220
Amanda Werner...

00:21:04.220 --> 00:21:06.220
How do you know who I am?

00:21:15.340 --> 00:21:17.000
You're...

00:21:18.940 --> 00:21:22.200
I'm Snow.

00:21:54.070 --> 00:22:05.190
I dreamed of that day we chased shooting stars

00:22:05.190 --> 00:22:15.600
What we had kept safe disappeared like sand

00:22:15.600 --> 00:22:19.670
Just another illusion

00:22:19.670 --> 00:22:28.770
Asleep, inside memories

00:22:30.010 --> 00:22:32.310
Wish for the stars

00:22:32.310 --> 00:22:40.850
Holding countless wishes with both hands

00:22:40.850 --> 00:22:43.420
A wish for the stars

00:22:43.420 --> 00:22:51.370
Quietly by your side, as you sleep

00:22:51.370 --> 00:22:57.000
Yes, right next to you

00:22:57.000 --> 00:23:02.980
Holding countless wishes

00:23:02.980 --> 00:23:08.740
Yes, right beside you

00:23:12.520 --> 00:23:18.030
The two met, traveled together,
and then strayed down separate paths.

00:23:18.030 --> 00:23:23.200
After being hurt and surviving battles,
they come across each other again.

00:23:23.200 --> 00:23:27.300
Episode 19: "Quondam Affections."

00:23:27.300 --> 00:23:32.100
...To convey once more the
entrusted feelings of the past.
